  "prefLabel": "Eth 102.01 Agency",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Eth 102.01 “Agency” means “agency” as defined in RSA 21-G:21, I, namely, “any executive branch agency, department, division, board, commission, or entity of the executive branch.”\n\nSource. #12617-A, eff 9-6-18",
